  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e05-scene-04",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "总编室借调  (Seconded From Administration)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xiaoye": "小叶",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Short of staff while Kaiwen is in hospital, the chief editor's office temporarily transfers Bu Xiaogu out of administration, and Xiaoye sees right through Xiaogu's polite hesitation. Listen to their Mandarin conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "小谷，总编室把你借调过去了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "赶紧走吧，已经录入系统了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "你还磨蹭什么呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "你不是最讨厌行政工作了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没有啊，怎么会？完全没有！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "别装了，看你一天到晚魂不守舍那样。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "赶紧走吧，以为我看着你不烦呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我真的去总编室帮忙啦！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "快去吧，那边事情多着呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "亲爱的雷总，再见！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "小谷，总编室把你借调过去了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, the chief editor's office has seconded you over there.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "赶紧走吧，已经录入系统了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hurry on over; it has already been entered into the system.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "你还磨蹭什么呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why are you still dawdling?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "你不是最讨厌行政工作了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you not hate administrative work the most?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没有啊，怎么会？完全没有！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Not at all, how could I? Definitely not!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "别装了，看你一天到晚魂不守舍那样。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stop pretending; look at how distracted you have been all day long.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "赶紧走吧，以为我看着你不烦呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Go on now; do you think watching you mope does not wear me out?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我真的去总编室帮忙啦！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then I am really heading over to help in the chief editor's office!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "快去吧，那边事情多着呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hurry over; there is plenty of work waiting there.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "亲爱的雷总，再见！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Dear Director Lei, goodbye!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "小谷，总编室把你借调过去了。",
      "gap": 0.5
